From 22f5cf39f4a1ee7e51e72589ff7b429ea11d7264 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sat, 21 Feb 2026 09:15:43 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add skill-matcher: intelligent skill recommendation and
 auto-activation

Adds a new meta-skill that automatically analyzes user prompts and recommends
the most relevant skills from installed plugins and external catalogs.

Key features:
- Automatic intent analysis from user messages
- Keyword-based skill matching across 6 categories (Documents, Development,
  Design, Communication, Testing, Meta)
- Smart filtering to avoid recommendations for trivial tasks
- External catalog search when no local skill matches
- Skill creation suggestions for repetitive workflows

The skill includes:
- Category mapping with bilingual keywords (EN/RU)
- Full skill catalog reference
- External source integration guide
- Utility script for scanning local skills

This complements the existing skill-creator by helping users discover when
and how to use skills, and identifying gaps where new skills should be created.
